@startuml
title ioScope Logical Class View With Responsibilities
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false

class ioScopeShell {
  +Runs the professor-facing oscilloscope shell.
}
class ioPipelineCli {
  +Builds and runs the transfer pipeline from CLI arguments.
}
class ioLegacyFtdiCli {
  +Preserves the older direct FTDI demo commands.
}
class ioFileComparator {
  +Compares two files byte for byte.
}

class ioOscilloscopeController {
  +Orchestrates UI actions, model updates, and rendering.
}
abstract class ioOscilloscopeView {
  +Defines the single shared View contract for both UIs.
}
class ioCompactOscilloscopeView {
  +Renders the compact Qt interface.
}
class ioDetailedOscilloscopeView {
  +Renders the detailed Qt interface.
}
interface ioOscilloscopeWindow {
  +Defines an optional window-host protocol outside the primary Qt path.
}
class ioQtScopeWindow {
  +Hosts and switches the two Qt view instances without becoming a second View.
}
class ioTkOscilloscopeWindow <<legacy>> {
  +Preserves the older Tk shell window outside the primary Qt path.
}
class ioOscilloscopeModel {
  +Stores raw samples, processed samples, and UI state.
}
class ioControlState {
  +Stores timing, source, FTDI, scale, and offset settings.
}
class ioViewportState {
  +Stores the visible sample window position and size.
}
class ioRenderState {
  +Carries immutable render data into the View layer.
}
class ioScopeSettingsStore {
  +Persists and reloads professor-facing settings.
}

class ioLiveOscilloscopeSession {
  +Owns the live acquisition session and tee-output pipeline.
}
class ioLiveSampleHistory {
  +Stores rolling normalized samples for live rendering.
}
class ioTappedReadableByteStream {
  +Copies live input bytes into sample history while preserving stream reads.
}
class ioLiveFileTailByteStream {
  +Tails a file as a continuously readable byte stream.
}
class ioGeneratedWaveformByteStream {
  +Exposes generated waveforms as a readable byte stream.
}
class ioNullWritableByteStream {
  +Discards tee output while preserving pipeline flow.
}

interface ioSignalFilter {
  +Defines one waveform filter step.
}
abstract class ioSampleMappingFilterBase {
  +Shares simple sample-mapping behavior.
}
class ioScaleFilter {
  +Applies vertical scaling.
}
class ioOffsetFilter {
  +Applies vertical shifting.
}
class ioFilterPipeline {
  +Runs filters in deterministic order.
}

interface ioSignalSource {
  +Defines one waveform acquisition strategy.
}
class ioGeneratedWaveformSource {
  +Builds deterministic demo waveforms.
}
class ioFileWaveformSource {
  +Loads normalized samples from a file.
}
class ioFtdiWaveformSource {
  +Loads normalized samples from an FTDI device.
}
class ioWaveformGenerator {
  +Selects the active signal source.
}

abstract class ioViewTheme {
  +Defines the theme contract for a View.
}
abstract class ioStaticThemeBase {
  +Shares static theme metadata behavior.
}
class ioPortraitTheme {
  +Provides the portrait color palette.
}
class ioLandscapeTheme {
  +Provides the landscape color palette.
}

class ioLibraryError {
  +Defines the base IO library runtime error.
}
class ioFtdiError {
  +Defines FTDI-specific IO library failures.
}
interface ioStreamLifecycle {
  +Defines stream open and close behavior.
}
interface ioReadableByteStream {
  +Defines read-side byte stream behavior.
}
interface ioWritableByteStream {
  +Defines write-side byte stream behavior.
}
abstract class ioAbstractReadableByteStream {
  +Shares readable-stream validation and lifecycle.
}
abstract class ioAbstractWritableByteStream {
  +Shares writable-stream validation and lifecycle.
}
abstract class ioAbstractSessionBackedByteStream {
  +Shares FTDI-session-backed stream behavior.
}
abstract class ioAbstractFileBackedByteStream {
  +Shares file-backed stream behavior.
}
class ioFtdiByteStream {
  +Reads bytes from an FTDI device.
}
class ioFtdiOutputByteStream {
  +Writes bytes to an FTDI device.
}
class ioFileInputByteStream {
  +Reads bytes from a file.
}
class ioFileByteStream {
  +Writes bytes to a file.
}
class ioFtdiSession {
  +Owns the D2XX session boundary.
}
class ioFtdiDevice {
  +Provides the canonical professor-facing FTDI adapter.
}
class FtdiDevice <<alias>> {
  +Preserves the older adapter name as a compatibility alias.
}

class ioPipelineConfig {
  +Stores end-to-end pipeline settings.
}
class ioAcquisitionConfig {
  +Stores read worker settings.
}
class ioTransferConfig {
  +Stores write worker settings.
}
class ioPipelineController {
  +Builds and coordinates the transfer pipeline.
}
class ioDataBuffer {
  +Implements the one shared thread-safe circular buffer used by the required transfer path.
}
abstract class ioByteCountMonitorBase {
  +Shares byte counting and throughput timing behavior.
}
abstract class ioThreadedWorkerBase {
  +Shares worker thread lifecycle behavior.
}
abstract class ioAbstractThreadedStreamWorker {
  +Shares threaded stream worker behavior.
}
class ioUsbReadController {
  +Pushes bytes from a stream into the buffer.
}
class ioUsbWriteController {
  +Drains bytes from the buffer into a stream.
}
class ioRecoveryManager {
  +Coordinates safe-stop recovery behavior.
}
class ioAcquisitionMonitor {
  +Tracks read counts and throughput.
}
class ioThroughputMonitor {
  +Tracks write counts and throughput.
}
abstract class ioRateSchedulerBase {
  +Shares rate scheduling behavior.
}
class ioInputScheduler {
  +Schedules read-side timing.
}
class ioOutputScheduler {
  +Schedules write-side timing.
}

class ioBuffer <<legacy>> {
  +Preserves the older fixed-size buffer abstraction.
}
abstract class ioBaseIoOperation <<legacy>> {
  +Shares the older timed FTDI operation behavior.
}
class ioRead <<legacy>> {
  +Reads bytes into the older legacy buffer.
}
class ioWrite <<legacy>> {
  +Writes bytes out from the older legacy buffer.
}

ioScopeShell --> ioOscilloscopeController
ioScopeShell --> ioScopeSettingsStore
ioPipelineCli --> ioPipelineController
ioLegacyFtdiCli --> ioFtdiDevice

ioCompactOscilloscopeView --|> ioOscilloscopeView
ioDetailedOscilloscopeView --|> ioOscilloscopeView
ioTkOscilloscopeWindow ..> ioOscilloscopeWindow
ioQtScopeWindow --> ioCompactOscilloscopeView
ioQtScopeWindow --> ioDetailedOscilloscopeView
ioQtScopeWindow --> ioOscilloscopeController
ioOscilloscopeController --> ioOscilloscopeModel
ioOscilloscopeController --> ioOscilloscopeView
ioOscilloscopeController --> ioRenderState
ioOscilloscopeController --> ioLiveOscilloscopeSession
ioOscilloscopeModel --> ioControlState
ioOscilloscopeModel --> ioViewportState
ioOscilloscopeModel --> ioFilterPipeline
ioOscilloscopeModel --> ioWaveformGenerator
ioOscilloscopeView --> ioViewTheme

ioLiveOscilloscopeSession --> ioLiveSampleHistory
ioLiveOscilloscopeSession --> ioTappedReadableByteStream
ioLiveOscilloscopeSession --> ioLiveFileTailByteStream
ioLiveOscilloscopeSession --> ioGeneratedWaveformByteStream
ioLiveOscilloscopeSession --> ioNullWritableByteStream
ioLiveOscilloscopeSession --> ioPipelineController

ioSampleMappingFilterBase --|> ioSignalFilter
ioScaleFilter --|> ioSampleMappingFilterBase
ioOffsetFilter --|> ioSampleMappingFilterBase
ioFilterPipeline ..> ioSignalFilter

ioGeneratedWaveformSource ..|> ioSignalSource
ioFileWaveformSource ..|> ioSignalSource
ioFtdiWaveformSource ..|> ioSignalSource
ioWaveformGenerator ..> ioSignalSource
ioFtdiWaveformSource ..> ioFtdiByteStream

ioPortraitTheme --|> ioStaticThemeBase
ioLandscapeTheme --|> ioStaticThemeBase
ioStaticThemeBase --|> ioViewTheme

ioFtdiError --|> ioLibraryError
ioReadableByteStream --|> ioStreamLifecycle
ioWritableByteStream --|> ioStreamLifecycle
ioAbstractReadableByteStream ..|> ioReadableByteStream
ioAbstractWritableByteStream ..|> ioWritableByteStream
ioFtdiByteStream --|> ioAbstractReadableByteStream
ioFtdiOutputByteStream --|> ioAbstractWritableByteStream
ioFileInputByteStream --|> ioAbstractReadableByteStream
ioFileByteStream --|> ioAbstractWritableByteStream
ioFtdiByteStream --|> ioAbstractSessionBackedByteStream
ioFtdiOutputByteStream --|> ioAbstractSessionBackedByteStream
ioFileInputByteStream --|> ioAbstractFileBackedByteStream
ioFileByteStream --|> ioAbstractFileBackedByteStream
ioAbstractSessionBackedByteStream --> ioFtdiSession
ioFtdiDevice --|> ioFtdiSession
FtdiDevice ..> ioFtdiDevice : compatibility alias

ioPipelineController --> ioPipelineConfig
ioPipelineController --> ioDataBuffer
ioPipelineController --> ioUsbReadController
ioPipelineController --> ioUsbWriteController
ioUsbReadController --|> ioAbstractThreadedStreamWorker
ioUsbWriteController --|> ioAbstractThreadedStreamWorker
ioAbstractThreadedStreamWorker --|> ioThreadedWorkerBase
ioUsbReadController --> ioAcquisitionConfig
ioUsbWriteController --> ioTransferConfig
ioUsbReadController --> ioReadableByteStream
ioUsbWriteController --> ioWritableByteStream
ioAcquisitionMonitor --|> ioByteCountMonitorBase
ioThroughputMonitor --|> ioByteCountMonitorBase
ioUsbReadController --> ioAcquisitionMonitor
ioUsbWriteController --> ioThroughputMonitor
ioUsbReadController --> ioInputScheduler
ioUsbWriteController --> ioOutputScheduler
ioUsbReadController --> ioRecoveryManager
ioUsbWriteController --> ioRecoveryManager
ioInputScheduler --|> ioRateSchedulerBase
ioOutputScheduler --|> ioRateSchedulerBase

ioRead --|> ioBaseIoOperation
ioWrite --|> ioBaseIoOperation
ioBaseIoOperation --> ioBuffer
ioBaseIoOperation ..> ioFtdiSession

note right of ioOscilloscopeView
Grading constraint:
the View abstraction appears once.
The two selectable Qt UIs are concrete subclasses.
end note

note right of ioQtScopeWindow
This class is a host shell.
It owns visibility and high-level UI selection.
It does not replace the View abstraction.
end note

note bottom of ioTkOscilloscopeWindow
Retained for legacy compatibility only.
It should not be counted as the primary UI path.
end note

note right of ioLiveOscilloscopeSession
Live acquisition remains outside the View layer.
The controller owns the session.
The session owns the threaded pipeline and sample history.
end note

note bottom of ioDataBuffer
Current branch ships the required one-buffer design.
The extra-credit dual-buffer design is future work.
end note
@enduml
